     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">I want to plot the amount of sessions by device, on the &quot;x axi&quot; I want to plot the months, and in the &quot;y axi&quot; the sessions. <br></span><br>Something like this:<div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-UQMpSTBISRE/Viw9N7CrroI/AAAAAAAAAVE/yC-2sIw0rNc/s1600/plot3.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-UQMpSTBISRE/Viw9N7CrroI/AAAAAAAAAVE/yC-2sIw0rNc/s1600/plot3.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792368550914000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0gIbi6dIPiyI5NDv2cKSS3\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-UQMpSTBISRE/Viw9N7CrroI/AAAAAAAAAVE/yC-2sIw0rNc/s320/plot3.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"279\"></a></p><div><br><br style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">However, I just get this:</span><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-sW0Zp88b0bY/Viw8IxiX_mI/AAAAAAAAAUw/iHEbWixEK7c/s1600/plotlines.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-sW0Zp88b0bY/Viw8IxiX_mI/AAAAAAAAAUw/iHEbWixEK7c/s1600/plotlines.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792368550914000&amp;usg=AOvVaw05DAIUkPzOqBVvj383K3fP\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-sW0Zp88b0bY/Viw8IxiX_mI/AAAAAAAAAUw/iHEbWixEK7c/s1600/plotlines.png\" border=\"0\"></a><br></p><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">This is my code:</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">_______________________________________________________________</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>d3 &lt;- dispositivoxfuente %&gt;%</div><div>        group_by(año,mes,device.category) %&gt;%</div><div>        summarise(sesiones = sum(sessions))</div></div><div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">d3$device.category &lt;- factor(d3$device.category)</font><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">disp3 &lt;- ggplot(d3, aes(x = mes, y = sesiones, color = device.category)) +</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">        geom_line()</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">_______________________________________________________________</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">_______________________________________________________________</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">If I do this, I get blank plots:<br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">disp3 &lt;- ggplot(d3, aes(x = mes, y = sesiones, color = device.category)) +</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">        geom_line() + facet_wrap(~ año)</font></div></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">And this warning:</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><div>geom_path: Each group consist of only one observation. Do you need to adjust the group aesthetic?</div><div>geom_path: Each group consist of only one observation. Do you need to adjust the group aesthetic?</div></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">_______________________________________________________________</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-gxbcUuqVp84/Viw9AW9JwXI/AAAAAAAAAU8/_4vOIegZrms/s1600/plotlines2.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-gxbcUuqVp84/Viw9AW9JwXI/AAAAAAAAAU8/_4vOIegZrms/s1600/plotlines2.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792368550914000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3QYgpAdPkbl42MqGJxWaT8\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-gxbcUuqVp84/Viw9AW9JwXI/AAAAAAAAAU8/_4vOIegZrms/s1600/plotlines2.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">This is my data:</div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small\">d3 